      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "767",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "767．一个两位数与它的数字和相加，得 83．把这个两位数",
        "的十位数与个位数交换位置，并且把新得到的数与原来",
        "的数相加，他们的和等于 110．求这个两位数．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "768",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "768．一个两位数的十位数与个位数交换位置，并且把新得到",
        "的数加上原来的数，他们的和等于 88．从新得到的数",
        "减去原来的数，他们的差等于 54．求这个两位数．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "46．添括号"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "有时需要把多项式各项分成几组，然后把他们括到括号",
        "里．因为这是一种与去括号相反的恒等变形，所以很容易建",
        "立添括号的法则："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果括号前面是“$+$”号，那么括到括号里的各项符号都",
        "不变，例如：",
        "$x^3-5x^2+7x-8=(x^3-5x^2)+(7x-8)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果括号前面是“$-$”号，那么括到括号里的各项都要变",
        "号，例如：",
        "$a^4-3a^3+5a^2-8=a^4-(3a^3-5a^2+8)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "769",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "769．把多项式 $10x^3-5x^2y+6xy^2+y^3-10$ 写成两个多项式",
        "的和，使其中一个不含变量 $y$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "770",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "770．把多项式 $2a^4-3a^2b-a^3+b^2$ 写成两个二项式的差，使",
        "其中一个不含有变量 $b$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "771",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "771．把下列各式写成两个二项式的和：",
        "а）$3x^3-2x^2-x+4$；　　б）$-5y^4+4y^3+3y^2-2y$；"
      ]
    },
